<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-yr bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LW RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.75     MATURITY    13.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  ONE	 REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15	  SELL CONC  85</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
